note EventMath v1.8 — Black Neurodivergent Creator Monetization Analysis
note Problem: systemic disparity in who gets paid and how much
note Documented fact: Black creators earn ~35% less per follower than white creators
note               for equivalent reach, engagement, and content quality
note Compounding factor: neurodivergent voice labeled unconventional = brand risk
note Observed pattern: extreme white creators monetize freely, Black creators don't

